{
  "movie_id": 200701101,
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start_time": 0.3,
      "end_time": 1.6,
      "text": "What's that supposed to mean?"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 3.4,
      "end_time": 4.6,
      "text": "Ahh! They spotted us!"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 4.9,
      "end_time": 6.8,
      "text": "Why, you—! Stay baaaack!"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 6.9,
      "end_time": 7.3,
      "text": "Waahh?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 7.5,
      "end_time": 11.4,
      "text": "Don't wave your weapon so wildly, sis! It's dangerous!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 11.6,
      "end_time": 13.9,
      "text": "Let us provide them support, Miyako!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 14.1,
      "end_time": 15.2,
      "text": "Okie-dokie!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 15.4,
      "end_time": 45.8,
      "text": "Huh...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 17.3,
      "end_time": 21.4,
      "text": "These monsters all look kind of hurty and sad..."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 26.7,
      "end_time": 30.3,
      "text": "Monsters at our rear as well?! I'll handle them."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 30.6,
      "end_time": 32.5,
      "text": "You maintain a central position!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 38.5,
      "end_time": 39.5,
      "text": "Ahaha."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 39.7,
      "end_time": 43.7,
      "text": "Look at you, being protected by all these different girls!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 52.4,
      "end_time": 55.1,
      "text": "But for some reason, when I'm with you,"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 55.4,
      "end_time": 57.6,
      "text": "I can feel power welling up in my heart!  ♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 58.9,
      "end_time": 61.4,
      "text": "Yes. That is my lord's unique ability."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 61.7,
      "end_time": 63.5,
      "text": "To enhance the power of those who aid him."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 65.1,
      "end_time": 67.9,
      "text": "These artificial monsters seem quite strong,"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 68.2,
      "end_time": 71.4,
      "text": "but with my lord's assistance, they will present no danger."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 72.1,
      "end_time": 75.3,
      "text": "Hrmph! My apologies, but I must forge a path ahead!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 75.8,
      "end_time": 77.8,
      "text": "You don't know the way, do you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 78.0,
      "end_time": 80.5,
      "text": "We'll take the lead, so follow after us!"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 80.7,
      "end_time": 81.7,
      "text": "Hiyahhhh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 82.8,
      "end_time": 83.8,
      "text": "Haahhh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 87.9,
      "end_time": 89.2,
      "text": "Yaahhh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start_time": 90.4,
      "end_time": 90.9,
      "text": "Ahh?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start_time": 93.3,
      "end_time": 93.9,
      "text": "Eheh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start_time": 94.3,
      "end_time": 97.4,
      "text": "If any monsters slip past your massive swings,"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start_time": 97.6,
      "end_time": 99.0,
      "text": "I'll take them down in a flash!"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start_time": 99.4,
      "end_time": 102.1,
      "text": "No one's more in sync than us twins!"
    }
  ],
